Body:
@rekram1-node I think I have a working solution for this based on the discussion here. It adds support for excluding default rule files by prefixing them with `!` in the instructions array:

```
{
  instructions: ["!AGENTS.md", "AGENTS.local.md"]
}
```

For context, this was built with AI using OpenCode. I'm a professional senior software engineer but not familiar with this codebase or TypeScript, so feedback is welcome. 

The code changes follow the contribution guidelines to the best of my knowledge. Let me know if you'd like me to push it up for review.
